                        "review": "i expected this to be a complete remake since it's short form is literally \"HD\" but this version of painkiller is somehow a sequel, i never understand the thought behind it cuz usually with the remake they're free but this one has more maps separated into another DLC\n\nThe reason that i got this game too was cuz black edition doesn't work properly on my gaming laptop (considering how old it was) \n\nif you're going to try painkiller, i rather suggest you the black edition but you have to find the patch if you're on a gaming PC cuz there's some levels that you won't be able to progress due to how ass the physics were\n\n",
